		filter: "Stakeholder Engagement ",
		subfilter: " Effectiveness of Stakeholder Engagement",
		body: "Based on correspondence with citizens from the region, the respondent   held another meeting with one of the complainants in June 2015. The   respondent has documented that the issues raised by the citizens were   all covered by the respondent's ongoing follow-up work and monitoring. \nIt has been documented that the respondent has conducted extensive   stakeholder engagement and has used leverage to raise the concerns of   the local citizens and NGOs in the follow-up with the complainants and   has sought to include the stakeholders’ concerns into the agreements to   ensure progress.",
