		subfilter: " SLAPP/Retaliations",
		body: "However, DIAM’s decision to continue with the various legal proceedings in parallel with the   NCP’s actions – notably its decision to appeal against the court ruling of 21 September 2018 that cancelled 11   dismissals made on 15 and 17 May 2017 and found them to be anti-union – does not help lay the foundations for   social dialogue within the enterprise nor does it address the issue of the remediating adverse impacts. The NCP   regrets that DIAM did not reconsider its legal strategy after the initial court’s decision, as had been suggested.",
