		filter: "NCPs Investigation and Mediation Approaches ",
		subfilter: " Approaches/Penalties for Corporate Non-participation",
		body: "The NCP instructs its Secretariat to transmit this final statement to the French Embassy in   Cameroon, after its publication, as wells as to public bodies supporting the internationalisation   of the COPAGEF and SOMDIAA Groups.",
		page: "13",
