			" Changes of Actions/Policy Made by the Result of NCP Proceedings",
		body: "Bosch Limited by now employs   apprentices in a much lower number and concentrates on skill development. The NCP   welcomes these statements and recommends that employment schemes similar to OJT   and NETW should not be reintroduced either, and that close consultation and regular   communication on employment issues be maintained between Bosch Limited and   Robert BoschGmbH as its mother company responsive under the OECD Guidelines.",
