		subfilter: " Approaches/Penalties for Corporate Non-participation",
		body: "NBIM was given the opportunity, in line with the NCP’s procedures, to address the complaint via   dialogue/mediation or written procedure. NBIM chose the written procedure. The NCP pointed out   to NBIM in writing 13 February that the general presentation by NBIM could not be considered   response to the NCP specific 32 questions to NBIM dated 4 January.9 NBIM still did not, provide a   satisfactory response, in writing or orally. This is particularly regrettable in light of the Norwegian   people’s expectation that applies to state owned enterprises. 10",
