		filter: "State responsibility/Involvement ",
		subfilter: " NCPs Reference to State Regulation/View",
		body: "As a Dutch company, Mylan has a duty to comply with Dutch   CSR policy. This means, among other things, that the company   is obliged to avoid involvement in human rights violations   anywhere in the world. The Netherlands considers the death   penalty to be a serious human rights violation.",
