		subfilter: " NCPs Reference to State Regulation/View",
		body: "Overseas Business Risk advice does clearly state that the UK government   does not support business links to settlements in the Occupied Palestinian   Territories, because of their illegality in international law and associated   impacts. No specific advice is provided about other locations, facilities and   agencies associated in FCO Human Rights reports with breaches of   international law and associated adverse impacts.",
