		statement: "66e1346ebbfde1cb351464d8",
		filter: "Risk-based due diligence process under OECD Guidelines ",
		subfilter: " Leverage/Influence",
		body: "The UK NCP notes, that a number of factors potentially limit the company’s  \nleverage with its business partners: the extended duration of the contracts  \nentered into, national laws and state security considerations that limit 15 \ninformation available to G4S and its role in the facilities concerned, and some  \npotential human rights impacts of ending contracts.",
