		filter: "NCPs Investigation and Mediation Approaches ",
		subfilter: " Effective Cooperation between NCPs",
		body: "The NCP Secretariat requested Colombian NCP’ support, whose information was transmitted to the parties   with its agreement. The NCP requested the Regional Economic Service “Danube Balkans” at France   Embassy in Bulgaria, which is territorially competent for Albania. It provided information on social law   and management of Covid 19 in Albania. The NCP thanks the Colombian NCP and the Sofia Regional   Economic Service for their support.",
