		subfilter: " NCP Cooperation with Other Organisations",
		body: "The participation of representatives of PCSS from India, next to the representative of   IndustriALL from Geneva, proved to be very useful. The participation of the Area   Manager India and the Head Sustainable Development of Holcim, next to other   representatives of the headquarters in Switzerland, was also particularly useful for the   dialogue.",
