		body: "The IUF raised similar issues in a 2017 complaint to the US NCP against   The Coca-Cola Company (TCCC), which referred to TCCC’s business relationship   with CCA in terms of contributing to adverse impact. The US NCP accepted the   complaint, considered the issues raised and conducted a mediation process   between the parties in early 2018 in Washington.",
