		filter: "Risk-based due diligence process under OECD Guidelines ",
		subfilter: " Communication about Adverse Impacts",
		body: "On the basis of the reviewed documentation, the Independent Examiner considers that the  \ndisclosures prior to the coup in relation to ongoing and potential conflict, and the risks associated with  \nsuch conflict including to human rights, in Shan State and specifically near the Bawdwin mine did not  \nmeet the disclosure requirements of the OECD Guidelines Chapter III.",
