		subfilter: " Responsibilities towards Environment/Climate Change",
		body: "The LVNCP welcomes SIA OMNIVA’s updated internal policies and procedures  \nregarding its environmental and safety activities. The LVNCP invites the Company  \nto introduce risk-based due diligence and a system of environmental management  \nbased on accurate and truthful data and to do regular monitoring of its activities in  \nlight of its environmental and social objectives",
