		subfilter: " Responsibilities related to Workers' rights",
		body: "In this regard, this NCP recommends modifications to the multinational  \ncompany's responsible business conduct policy with regard to the following  \npoints: \n1. Workers cannot be defined as partners as they are not (usually)  \npartners, shareholders or profit from the company's sales (not referring  \nto commissions but to profits in the strict sense of the word). \n2. It is good for workers to have representation within a company of this  \nsize; they need their rights to be protected and their contracts discussed \nwith the bargaining power that only a validly recognised trade union can  \ngive them.",
