		subfilter: " Responsibilities towards Environment/Climate Change",
		body: "The OECD Guidelines require companies to collect and evaluate “adequate and timely information” on  \nenvironmental, health and safety impacts of projects. IFC Performance Standard 1 requires a process of  \nSocial and Environmental Assessment where risks and impacts are analysed in the context of the project’s  \narea of influence for the “key stages of the project cycle, including pre- construction, construction,  \noperations, and decommissioning or closure (...)” \n166",
