		filter: "Analysis of Context of the NCP Statements ",
		subfilter: " Referred International Convention/Treaty/Other Regulation",
		body: "53. The framework that became the UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights was  produced in 2008. The Guiding Principles were launched in 2010 and incorporated into the OECD  Guidelines in 2011",
