		filter: "Analysis of Context of the NCP Statements ",
		subfilter: " Referred International Convention/Treaty/Other Regulation",
		body: 'The Philippines is commended for being among the few countries to have implemented the "Free, Prior   and Informed Consent" provisions of the UN Declaration on the Rights of Indigenous Peoples (UNDRIP)',
		page: "18",
