		filter: "Analysis of Context of the NCP Statements ",
		subfilter: " Referred OECD Guidance Documents",
		body: "Even though the Air Freight and Logistics Sustainability Accounting Standards  \nprimarily looks at “sustainability” from the business perspective, namely as the   company’s ability to create value over the long term, their methods are not so   dissimilar to the approach advocated in the OECD Due Diligence Guidance for   Responsible Business Conduct",
		page: "4",
