		filter: "Analysis of Context of the NCP Statements ",
		subfilter: " Referred OECD Guidance Documents",
		body: "The OECD Due Diligence Guidance for Responsible Business Conduct (2018) highlights that when   the likelihood and severity of an adverse impact is high, then due diligence should be “more   extensive”.4",
