		subfilter: " Scope under Human Rights Due Diligence",
		body: "Human rights due diligence is not to be conflated with corporate due diligence, which enterprises  \ncommonly undertake to assess the risks to the enterprise of a corporate transaction. Although it can be  \nincorporated into broader enterprise risk management processes, human rights due diligence requires  \nan informed assessment of the risks to human rights-holders posed by an enterprise’s acts and omissions \nincluding as they relate to the enterprise’s business relationships",
