		filter: "Concept of Human Rights Due Diligence ",
		subfilter: " Scope under Human Rights Due Diligence",
		body: "Risk-based due diligence goes beyond simply  \nidentifying and managing material risks  \nto the enterprise itself, but must take in-to account adverse impacts on people,  \nthe environment or society that are either  \ncaused or contributed to by the enterprise,  \nor are directly linked to their operations,  \nproducts or services through a business  \nrelationship21.",
		page: "15",
