		body: "The Ministry of Defence should define  \nCSR requirements for suppliers and con-tinuously ensure compliance with these  \nrequirements. The Ministry should com-ply suppliers to provide self-assessments  \nupon which monitoring by the Ministry  \ncan be based.",
		page: "4",
