		filter: "Corporate responsibilities for Groups/Human Rights/Environment ",
		subfilter: " Responsibilities in Supply Chain",
		body: "Risk-based due diligence  \nrequirements should be part of procure-ment contracts with suppliers. In additi-on, the Ministry is encouraged to review  \nits suppliers’ self-assessments in connec-tion with an analysis of industry and coun-try risks. On this basis it should select is-sues to be monitored.",
